another gang member named Lucas Santiago, who was waiting in a white truck, and handed over the job to him. The white truck turned into the service road and Santiago spotted Rodrigo, who was sitting on the curb listening to music on his iPod. Santiago jumped out of the truck, shot Rodrigo five times with a 9mm gun, then got back in the truck and sped away. The hit now complete, the gang met up again at the same Burger King where they'd gone days earlier and had breakfast together. Another. Medina tried calling the inside man to confirm that the job was done, but he didn't answer the phone. Your call is important. Can't take being on hold anymore. Fizz is 100% online, so you can make the switch in minutes.

